{
  "name": "02 - Schedule Trigger",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 - Schedule Trigger\nSe ejecuta todos los días a las 08:00 cuando el workflow está **publicado**.\n\nPara probarlo sin esperar, pulsa **Execute workflow**: n8n ejecuta el trigger una vez.\n\nLa hora usa la zona horaria `GENERIC_TIMEZONE`.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "570b5348-b352-59b8-a0bb-efbd6f7c55c8",
      "name": "Nota 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "3b925436-205f-5326-98e9-666b211f580c",
      "name": "Cada día a las 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "55b2e485-8f76-5367-9f49-057df577530e",
              "name": "ejecutadoEn",
              "value": "={{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "84067204-77c4-5263-b62c-eac6124c6863",
              "name": "diaSemana",
              "value": "={{ $now.setLocale('es').toFormat('cccc') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cc1d493f-9b2d-5a1f-be06-032c92d3e8df",
              "name": "esFinDeSemana",
              "value": "={{ $now.weekday >= 6 }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "d5032044-bc51-507a-a674-3b4f13d7f6cb",
              "name": "zonaHoraria",
              "value": "={{ $now.zoneName }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3caf7a9d-a2f6-59e6-b298-8c693c330d63",
      "name": "Datos de la ejecución",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
